Evidence: NativeYieldPrecompile active genesis block【Phase 4 — Core Components】; "Semua address L2 menerima rebasing yield otomatis tanpa staking"【Phase 9 — Decision Timeline】; Narrative position "Native Yield / Real Yield" sebagai Main Narrative【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】
