## Failure Factors

Factor: TVL tidak sustainable tanpa continuous incentives — Peak $1.48B Mar 2024 → ~$400M Dec 2024 (73% decline) korelasi dengan Points season cycles
Evidence: TVL peak Mar 2024 $1.48B【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】; Points S1 snapshot Mar 2024【Phase 3 — EV-007】; S2 end Dec 2024【Phase 3 — EV-019】; TVL Dec 2024 ~$400M【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】; Phase 9 identifies "TVL decline post-Points Season 1" as risk【Phase 9 — Risk Response Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 8, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Centralization trust assumptions tinggi (sequencer, proposer, challenger, upgrade keys) — No forced inclusion, no permissionless challenge, no timelock
Evidence: Single sequencer Foundation-operated【Phase 4 — Core Components】; Permissioned proposer/challenger【Phase 4 — Security Model】; Upgrade keys Foundation multisig no timelock【Phase 4 — Security Model】; Phase 7 lists multiple centralization risks【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Tokenomics tidak memiliki value accrual mechanism — No burn, no buyback, no fee switch, high emissions, vesting undisclosed untuk 36.5% (team+investor)
Evidence: "Tidak ada native burn mechanism... Tidak ada buyback program resmi"【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】; Vesting schedules all "tidak diketahui"【Phase 6 — Vesting Schedule】; Phase 9 confirms no buyback/burn/fee switch【Phase 9 — Financial Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 6, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Treasury dan revenue opacity — No public treasury dashboard, no financial reports, yield retention rate undisclosed, sequencer revenue not transparan
Evidence: Treasury "tidak diungkap"【Phase 5 — Treasury】; Revenue History "tidak diungkap"【Phase 5 — Revenue History】; Native yield retention rate "not documented"【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】; Phase 7 lists "Treasury Concentration / Opaque Treasury Management"【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Execution client (blast-geth) tidak open source — Mencegah independent node operation, verification, dan community contribution
Evidence: "blast-geth execution client repo tidak public/verified open source"【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】; GitHub org no blast-geth repo【Phase 4 — Current Technical Stack】; Phase 7 lists "Execution Client Not Open Source" risk【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Governance infrastructure delayed — Portal not live, no council/committee, Foundation executes, DAO formation projected 2025 tapi no roadmap
Evidence: "gov.blast.io / Snapshot — not verified live"【Phase 6 — Governance】; "Council: Not formally established; Committee: Not formally established"【Phase 7 — Governance Ecosystem】; EV-020 projected 2025【Phase 3 — EV-020】; Phase 9 confirms "governance UI lower priority"【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 6, Phase 7, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Dependency pada dua L1 yield source (Lido + MakerDAO) tanpa diversification — Smart contract risk, governance risk, regulatory risk pada kedua protokol
Evidence: Lido stETH + MakerDAO Spark USDS only sources【Phase 4 — System Architecture】; Phase 7 External Dependencies both "Critical"【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】; Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks lists "L1 Yield Source Concentration"【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Factor: Canonical bridge 7-day withdrawal tanpa fast exit native — User experience buruk untuk traders; rely pada third-party bridges (Orbiter, LayerZero) yang tambah trust assumption
Evidence: "7-Day Withdrawal Delay" known limitation【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】; Third-party bridges listed separately【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】; Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks lists "Bridge Dependency"【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

## Decision Framework

Observe
→ Market gap: L2 wars saturated (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, zkSync); no L2 dengan native yield built-in
→ User pain point: Harus manual stake/bridge untuk yield; capital inefficiency
→ Founder insight: Blur NFT traders want yield on idle ETH/stablecoin
Evidence: Launch blog positioning【Phase 1 — Category】; Native yield as main narrative【Phase 8 — Narrative Position】; Blur integration【Phase 3 — EV-001】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 1, Phase 3, Phase 8
Confidence: HIGH

Evaluate
→ Technical: Optimistic Rollup (OP Stack fault proof) faster than ZK; custom yield precompile feasible; centralized sequencer acceptable for v1
→ Financial: Strategic VC funding sufficient; token incentives (53.5%) sebagai growth capital; no public sale needed
→ Legal: Cayman Foundation wrapper untuk token issuance flexibility
→ Ecosystem: Blur user base sebagai initial distribution; bootstrap DeFi trio via Gold
Evidence: Phase 9 Decision Timeline shows all evaluations【Phase 9 — Decision Timeline】; Technical choices documented【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern】; Financial choices【Phase 9 — Financial Decision Pattern】; Ecosystem choices【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 9 (all Decision Patterns)
Confidence: HIGH

Fund
→ Strategic round Paradigm + Standard Crypto Nov 2023 (~$20-30M)
→ Token allocation: 16.5% investors, 20% team, 10% foundation, 28% ecosystem, 25.5% community
→ No public sale, no launchpad
Evidence: EV-003 funding【Phase 3 — EV-003】; TGE allocation【Phase 6 — Distribution】; Phase 5 Funding History【Phase 5 — Funding History】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 5, Phase 6
Confidence: HIGH

Develop
→ Custom OP Stack fork: DisputeGame/Cannon dari OP Stack, custom NativeYieldPrecompile, custom blast-geth
→ Testnet Nov 2023 dengan Points S1
→ Mainnet Feb 2024 dengan native yield active
→ Contracts open source (GitHub), SDK open source, client closed source
Evidence: EV-002 testnet【Phase 3 — EV-002】; EV-006 mainnet【Phase 3 — EV-006】; GitHub contracts/SDK public【Phase 4 — Official Technical Resources】; blast-geth not public【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 4
Confidence: HIGH

Launch
→ Mainnet Feb 29 2024: native yield live, canonical bridge 7-day withdrawal
→ DeFi trio (Thruster, Ring, Wasabi) Mar-Apr 2024 via Gold
→ TGE Jun 26 2024: token live, 4 major CEX listings, Season 1 claim
→ Points S2 Jul 2024: expanded mechanics
Evidence: EV-006/008/009/010/012/013/014【Phase 3 — EV-006/EV-008/EV-009/EV-010/EV-012/EV-013/EV-014】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3
Confidence: HIGH

Govern
→ Post-TGE: Token-weighted voting activated, Foundation multisig executes
→ No governance portal live, no council/committee
→ DAO formation projected 2025 (EV-020)
→ Upgrade via Foundation multisig (v1.1 Nov 2024)
Evidence: Phase 6 Governance【Phase 6 — Governance】; Phase 7 Governance Ecosystem【Phase 7 — Governance Ecosystem】; EV-018 v1.1 upgrade【Phase 3 — EV-018】; EV-020 projected【Phase 3 — EV-020】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 6, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Iterate
→ v1.1 hard fork Nov 2024: performance, EIP-1559 tuning, EIP-2612 permit
→ Points S2 end Dec 2024, S3 mechanics TBD
→ Gold distributions ongoing
→ Ecosystem Fund Q4 2024 announced
Evidence: EV-018 v1.1【Phase 3 — EV-018】; EV-019 S2 end【Phase 3 — EV-019】; EV-017 Ecosystem Fund【Phase 3 — EV-017】; Phase 7 Grant Programs【Phase 7 — Grant Programs】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

## Reusable Playbook

Practice: Native yield sebagai core differentiator untuk L2 baru
How: Build custom precompile untuk rebasing yield dari L1 sources (stETH, T-bill) ke semua L2 address automatically. No user opt-in required. Fund via token emissions initially.
Evidence: NativeYieldPrecompile genesis deployment【Phase 4 — Core Components】; Automatic rebasing design【Phase 4 — Native Yield Distributor】; 53.5% allocation funds incentives【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 6
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Pre-mainnet Points program untuk bootstrap TVL dan sybil-resistant user base
How: Launch bridge + Points program 3-4 bulan sebelum mainnet. Reward deposits dengan points claimable at TGE. Creates pre-launch TVL dan community.
Evidence: Points S1 Nov 2023 pre-mainnet【Phase 3 — EV-004】; >500k addresses deposited【Phase 3 — EV-006】; TVL peak $1.48B【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 8
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Gold/Builder incentive program untuk bootstrap DeFi primitives rapidly
How: Allocate significant token supply (28%) ke ecosystem incentives. Target core primitives: DEX, lending, derivatives. Distribute based on KPIs (TVL, volume).
Evidence: Gold program announced Nov 2023【Phase 3 — EV-005】; Thruster/Ring/Wasabi live Mar-Apr 2024【Phase 3 — EV-008/EV-009/EV-010】; All receive Gold【Phase 7 — Applications】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Founder-led ecosystem leverage (existing user base dari previous project)
How: Jika founder memiliki previous successful project (Blur), integrate deeply. Shared user base, liquidity, brand trust.
Evidence: Tieshun co-founder Blur & Blast【Phase 2 — Entity: Tieshun Roquerre】; Blur integration in launch blog【Phase 3 — EV-001】; Phase 9 confirms "Blur has established NFT trader base"【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2, Phase 3, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Strategic VC funding tanpa public sale untuk maintain control dan reduce regulatory risk
How: Raise dari top-tier VC (Paradigm, Standard Crypto) via private round. Allocate token supply to investors (16.5%). No public sale, no launchpad.
Evidence: Media reports strategic round【Phase 3 — EV-003】; Investor allocation 16.5%【Phase 6 — Distribution】; No public sale in TGE【Phase 6 — TGE】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 6
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Modular tech adoption — reuse battle-tested components, build custom differentiation
How: Gunakan OP Stack fault proof (Cannon/DisputeGame) sebagai settlement layer. Build custom yield layer, custom sequencer, custom native token precompile.
Evidence: DisputeGame dari OP Stack【Phase 4 — Core Components】; NativeYieldPrecompile custom【Phase 4 — Core Components】; Phase 9 Technical Decision Pattern【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: Major CEX listings at TGE untuk immediate liquidity dan accessibility
How: Secure Binance, Bybit, OKX, Gate.io listings simultaneous dengan TGE. Spot + perpetual markets.
Evidence: TGE Jun 26 2024 listed 4 CEX【Phase 3 — EV-013】; Spot + perpetual【Phase 8 — Trading Markets】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 8
Confidence: HIGH

Practice: EVM equivalence + custom SDK untuk developer experience
How: Full EVM equivalence (type 2/3). Provide Blast SDK (@blastl2/sdk) yang abstraksi native yield, bridge, Points contracts. Support Foundry/Hardhat/Viem/Ethers.
Evidence: EVM equivalence claim【Phase 4 — Execution Environment】; Blast SDK open source【Phase 4 — Development Framework】; All major tools supported【Phase 7 — Developer Ecosystem】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7
Confidence: HIGH

## Anti-patterns

Anti-pattern: Over-centralization at launch tanpa concrete decentralization roadmap
Manifestation: Single sequencer, permissioned proposer/challenger, Foundation multisig upgrade keys no timelock, no forced inclusion, no permissionless challenge game. Roadmap decentralization tidak dipublikasikan.
Evidence: All centralization points documented【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】; Phase 7 lists 3 centralization risks【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Risks】; Phase 9 confirms "roadmap decentralization tidak dipublikasikan"【Phase 9 — Decision Timeline】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 7, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern: Tokenomics tanpa value accrual mechanism (no burn, no buyback, no fee switch) dengan high emissions
Manifestation: Fixed supply tapi 53.5% emissions untuk incentives, vesting undisclosed untuk team/investor (36.5%), no protocol revenue sharing ke token holders.
Evidence: "Tidak ada native burn mechanism... Tidak ada buyback program resmi"【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】; Vesting undisclosed【Phase 6 — Vesting Schedule】; Phase 9 confirms no fee switch【Phase 9 — Financial Decision Pattern】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 6, Phase 9
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern: Treasury opacity by design (Cayman Foundation, no dashboard, no reports)
Manifestation: Treasury size/composition/custodian undisclosed. Up